# Raw video sources — heavy, never web-ready as-is, and the client keeps
# dropping full originals into assets/video/. Only the encoded hero.mp4
# (+ poster) actually belong in the repo; GitHub also hard-blocks any
# single file over 100MB, so an accidental `git add -A` here would fail
# the push outright instead of just bloating history.
assets/video/*
!assets/video/hero.mp4
!assets/video/hero-poster.jpg
